<section xml:id="syllabus-fall-2026">
  <title>MATH 1551 Syllabus (Fall 2026)</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      <term>Course:</term> Differential Calculus, Sections A/C/F/G/H/HP/K/M (2 Credits)
    </p>
    <p>
      <term>Term:</term> Fall 2026
    </p>
  </introduction>

